  "zh": "# 今日热点聚焦云计算并购、AI科研突破及全球经贸动态\n## AI与科技\n- **Cloudflare 收购 Deno**：云巨头强化边缘计算与开发者生态，标志着云原生格局加速整合。\n- **Typesafe AI 融资8.7亿**：AI基础设施融资规模创新高，显示资本对模型服务平台的看涨。\n- **AI挖掘档案发现陨石犀牛**：利用AI挖掘历史档案，成功定位陨石及濒危物种线索，彰显跨学科价值。\n## 产业与经济\n- **广交会即将开幕**：全球最大贸易展览会拉开序幕，预计带动外贸复苏与供应链重塑。\n- **出口暴涨160%废料抢手**：废旧原料因绿色需求激增，出口暴涨反映循环经济新机遇。\n## 国际与社会\n- **13岁女孩信获全球金奖**：少年视角的环保倡议获国际认可，激发青少年公众参与热情。\n- **俄鼠疫谣言广泛流传**：虚假疫情信息在社交平台快速发酵，凸显公共卫生谣言治理的紧迫性。",
  "en": "# Today's highlights: Cloudflare's Deno acquisition, AI-driven discoveries, and key global trade and health developments\n## AI & Tech\n- **Cloudflare Deno**：Cloudflare's acquisition of Deno strengthens its edge computing and developer ecosystem, signaling accelerated consolidation in the cloud-native landscape.\n- **Typesafe AI fund**：Typesafe AI's $870M funding round marks a record high for AI infrastructure investment, reflecting strong bullish sentiment toward model-serving platforms.\n- **AI uncovers relics**：By mining historical archives with AI, researchers located a forgotten meteorite and endangered rhino traces, showcasing the power of cross‑disciplinary data science.\n## Industry & Economy\n- **Canton Fair opens**：The Canton Fair kicks off, poised to boost global trade recovery and reshape supply chains amid post‑pandemic demand.\n- **Export surge scrap**：A 160% jump in exports of recycled scrap highlights surging green demand and emerging opportunities in the circular economy.\n## International & Society\n- **Teen girl award**：A 13‑year‑old Chinese girl’s environmental letter winning a unique global prize inspires youth engagement in public affairs.\n- **Rat plague rumors**：The rapid spread of false rat‑plague rumors on social media underscores the urgent need to combat health‑related misinformation."
